<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #e74c3c;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    p {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #555;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e74c3c;
      color: white !important;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #c0392b;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #888;
    }
    .code {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="logo">Active Agent</div>

  <h1>Verify your email</h1>

  <p>Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>

  <p>Thanks for signing up for Active Agent! Click the button below to verify your email address and get started building AI agents.</p>

  <a href="<%= @verification_url %>" class="button">Verify Email Address</a>

  <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
  <p class="code" style="word-break: break-all;"><%= @verification_url %></p>

  <p>This link will expire in 24 hours. If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>Active Agent - The AI Framework for Ruby on Rails</p>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Active Agent. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
